	<section class=\"container faq-section section\"><div><h2>Before you<br><em>roll up your sleeves.</em></h2></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details><summary>What should I bring?</summary><p>Wear comfortable clothes that can get dusty, tie back long hair and keep jewellery away from the clay. All making materials are part of the sample workshop concept.</p></details><details><summary>Do I take my piece home that day?</summary><p>Wet clay needs to dry before it can be fired. A real booking would confirm firing, glazing, collection arrangements and any fees in advance. This demo does not promise a finished piece or collection date.</p></details><details><summary>Can I come with a friend?</summary><p>The concept is well suited to making together. Group size and access needs would be discussed before booking; there are no live places to reserve here.</p></details></div></section>
